    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Elliott",
      "key": "Introduction",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Ah, the new farmer we've all been expecting... and whose arrival has sparked many a conversation!#$b#I'm Elliott... I live in the little cabin by the beach. It's a pleasure to meet you.",
      "translation": "Ach, nová tvář z farmy, na kterou jsme všichni čekali... a jejíž příjezd vyvolal nejednu rozmluvu!#$b#Já jsem Elliott... Bydlím v malé chatce u pláže. Je mi potěšením tě poznat.",
      "sourceSHA256": "d7642e852c20f9569beb9ca5f0be59d98f0139d92dd7cf10999c8fe5c61edf9e",
      "translationSHA256": "26d02255d7c9a3b335b4015be396c257352ea233e5689c00d15df8eb03936b86",
