      "key": "AcceptGift_Positive_forage_item_beach",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Ah, you've been doing some beach combing... A fine hobby! Thank you.",
      "translation": "Ach, hledání pokladů na pláži... Znamenitý koníček! Děkuju.",
