      "key": "AcceptGift_Positive_book_item",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Ah, a book... Yes, perhaps the prose within these pages will offer a new insight. Thank you.",
      "translation": "Ach, kniha... Ano, snad mi próza na těchto stránkách nabídne nový pohled. Děkuju.",
      "sourceSHA256": "8ab9a60e433198c915473687d44b56cfcf0224f09b1311d5709e4ed41dae2150",
      "translationSHA256": "9461e13d3b0e3fea5fc4168e416681fa4b7c4b782649086c3d521c9c6d24443c",
