    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Elliott",
      "key": "AcceptGift_(O)814",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Ah, a bottle of fine ink. A writer can never have too much... and it's quite expensive! Thank you!$h",
      "translation": "Ach, lahvička kvalitního inkoustu. Spisovatel ho nikdy nemá dost... a navíc je docela drahý! Děkuju!$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "74354710c8bee27d3cc88a291994f2f8170d3a954785398eeb8b5db47397c70e",
      "translationSHA256": "458a6d6428c28253cc32e2682b062ed5f6c0f6ce8586042bfd1418f16819032e",
