      "key": "firstVisit_ElliottHouse",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Ah... please excuse the mess in my cabin. I wasn't expecting anyone to enter!",
      "translation": "Ach... omluv prosím nepořádek v mé chatce. Nečekal jsem, že někdo vstoupí!",
      "sourceSHA256": "db1f5b0c7ee2b89572f5e2d96319f60eae007c2b6dfc586d09303daeed0feb97",
      "translationSHA256": "617df103c5493f4cd6102f25b2862f473d1df9902779f815e21884b2406d5104",
